of frozen-thawed Asian elephant (<italic>Elephas maximus</italic>) spermatozoa</article-title><source>Int J Androl</source><year>2006</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>346</fpage><lpage>352</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16533357</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2605.2005.00578.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thongtip</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Damyang</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mahasawangkul</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kongsila</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Angkawanich</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Jansittiwate</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Thitaram</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Phongsopawijit</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Frozen semen artificial insemination in an Asian elephants (<italic>Elephas maximus</italic>) using endoscope and ultrasound guide</article-title><source>41st Kasetsart University Animal Conference, Bangkok</source><year>2003</year><fpage>312</fpage><lpage>315</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schmitt</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hildebrandt</surname><given-names>TB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Manual collection and characterization of semen from Asian elephants (<italic>Elephas maximus</italic>)</article-title><source>Anim Reprod Sci</source><year>1998</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>314</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9835384</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0378-4320(98)00120-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hafez</sur